# 📌 Project Overview

The **Social Media Platforms Performance Dashboard** is an interactive Business Intelligence solution developed in **Microsoft Power BI** to evaluate and compare the performance of leading social media platforms.

The dashboard consolidates engagement, virality, conversation volume, and sentiment metrics into a centralized reporting interface, enabling marketers, digital strategists, and business leaders to assess campaign effectiveness, audience interactions, and overall platform performance.

Designed with a clean executive-style layout, the dashboard enables quick decision-making through intuitive visualizations and dynamic KPI reporting.


