# 💼 Business Problem

Organizations invest significant resources into social media marketing but often struggle to determine:

- Which platform generates the highest engagement.
- Where audiences interact the most.
- Which platforms drive conversations.
- Overall audience sentiment toward published content.
- Performance trends across different time periods.

This dashboard addresses these challenges by presenting key performance metrics in an interactive and easy-to-understand format.

# 🎯 Project Objectives

The objectives of this dashboard are to:

- Monitor social media performance across multiple platforms.
- Compare engagement levels between platforms.
- Measure virality and audience conversations.
- Analyze audience sentiment.
- Track performance trends over time.
- Support data-driven marketing decisions.
- Identify high-performing platforms and content opportunities.


